  - kind: 1
    emotion: shock
    text: Tell me I'm seeing things. Did a fellow with river weed on his coat just
      walk down the back stairs, leaving wet puddles all the way to the alley?
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: 
    optionB: 
    next: -1
    nextA: -1
    nextB: -1
    rule:
      parameter: 
      greaterThan: 0
    remember: 
    value: 0
  - kind: 2
    emotion: whisper
    text: The whole harbor's gone mad today. Troops blocked off Pier 2, and that
      stray poodle with the red glass eye bit through a chain at the battery works.
      Just keep the ads away from the political column so we can go home in one piece.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: We'll get through the shift.
    optionB: Go check the ink rollers.
    next: -1
    nextA: 3
    nextB: 4
    rule:
      parameter: 
      greaterThan: 0
    remember: 
    value: 0
  - kind: 1
    emotion: smile
    text: Yeah. Only a few days left in the week. I'll keep the press warm.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: 
    optionB: 
    next: 5
    nextA: -1
    nextB: -1
    rule:
      parameter: 
      greaterThan: 0
    remember: 
    value: 0
  - kind: 1
    emotion: default
    text: Right, right. Back to the cellar I go.
